     "body": "<p>This doesn't relate to \n    <span class=\"jira-issue-macro resolved\" data-jira-key=\"FCREPO-1340\" >\n                <a href=\"https://fedora-repository.atlassian.net/browse/FCREPO-1340\" class=\"jira-issue-macro-key issue-link\"  title=\"Rejigger Checkstyles to work around Java 8 idioms\" >\n            <img class=\"icon\" src=\"https://fedora-repository.atlassian.net/rest/api/2/universal_avatar/view/type/issuetype/avatar/10303?size=medium\" />\n            FCREPO-1340\n        </a>\n                                                    <span class=\"aui-lozenge aui-lozenge-subtle aui-lozenge-success jira-macro-single-issue-export-pdf\">Closed</span>\n            </span>\n</p>\n\n<p>This simply allows test code to be written like this:</p>\n\n<p>private Node mockNode1, mockNode2, mockNode3, mockNode4;</p>\n\n<p>instead of like this:</p>\n\n<p>private Node mockNode1;</p>\n\n<p>private Node mockNode2;</p>\n\n<p>private Node mockNode3;</p>\n\n<p>private Node mockNode4;</p>",
     "created": "19/Apr/16 12:20 PM",
